<title>USA: Equity Corp Q3 shr $0.11 vs $0.08.</title>
<headline>Equity Corp Q3 shr $0.11 vs $0.08.</headline>
<dateline>LUFKIN, Texas 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months Ended  For the Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>		  9/30/96     9/30/95     9/30/96	  9/30/95</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p>  Funeral $13,161,000  $8,663,000 $40,232,000(a)  $25,321,000</p>
<p>  Cemetery  7,891,000   7,009,000   25,426,000     19,662,000</p>
<p>	     21,052,000  15,672,000   65,658,000     44,983,000</p>
<p>Costs and expenses:</p>
<p>  Funeral   9,828,000   6,997,000  28,770,000(a)   19,477,000</p>
<p>  Cemetery  5,981,000   4,931,000   18,125,000     13,653,000</p>
<p>	     15,809,000  11,928,000   46,895,000     33,130,000</p>
<p>Total gross</p>
<p>   profit   5,243,000   3,744,000   18,763,000     11,853,000</p>
<p>General and administrative</p>
<p>  expenses  1,490,000   1,207,000    4,370,000	3,442,000</p>
<p>Operating income</p>
<p>		3,753,000   2,537,000   14,393,000	8,411,000</p>
<p>Interest expense</p>
<p>		  203,000     573,000    1,690,000	1,297,000</p>
<p>Income before income taxes</p>
<p>		3,550,000   1,964,000   12,703,000	7,114,000</p>
<p>Provision for income taxes</p>
<p>		1,438,000     776,000  5,709,000(b)     2,810,000</p>
<p>Net income</p>
<p>		2,112,000   1,188,000    6,994,000	4,304,000</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>			.11	.08(c)	    .40	   .29(c)</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common</p>
<p>shares  19,447,000  14,902,000(c) 17,583,000  14,807,000(c)</p>
<p>Notes: (a)  Reflects funeral revenues and related costs of $2,085,000 and $1,135,000, respectively, resulting in a pretax gain of $950,000 for the buyout of several long-term licensing and lease agreements.  </p>
<p>(b)  Reflects a charge for the required change in the company's Federal Income Tax rate from 34 percent to 35 percent of $565,000, to revalue deferred tax liabilities.</p>
<p>(c)  Restated to reflect the company's 3-for-2 stock split effective Oct. 2, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
